  "caveats": [
    "A unit is cell-matched but not DOI-matched: the same ligand measured under two metals in two different papers still counts, so part of Delta can be a paper effect. The interaction_share subtracts replicate noise, not between-paper drift.",
    "n_groups counts units, not independent ligands; a ligand measured in ten cell lines contributes ten units. n_ligands is reported next to it.",
    "Pairs below 20 units are marked UNSUPPORTED. That threshold is a rule of thumb for estimating a variance, not a power calculation."
  ]
